        "content": "### SLA reference (per calendar month)\n- **Prod 99.9 %**, 24/7 except planned maintenance: 43.2 min in a 30-day month (40.3–44.6 min for 28–31 days). Planned maintenance is not excluded here.\n- **tt02 99.8 %** of all hours in the month, but only downtime Mon–Fri 07:00–20:00 counts: 86.4 min in a 30-day month (80.6–89.3 min for 28–31 days). The recording rule counts 05:00–19:00 UTC, which covers 07:00–20:00 in both summer and winter time.\n- One sample per minute: each down sample counts as 1 min of downtime.\n- Default range is the last 30 days. Pick 'Previous month' in the time picker for a calendar month.",
